{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "f047a5c45a916c319d939c2124248e1573329af27384382517ded4823cc34d2a", "ja": "温かなクリスマス", "zh": "温馨的圣诞节", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e6603a2a7086eb7b5cb1a51c2bf73c72c2ace322b5eeda7e5a88cc21792fd08c", "ja": "公演で新曲のクリスマスソングを披露する\r\nことになった真、千鶴、エレナ、瑞希。\r\n4人のクリスマスの思い出話がきっかけと\r\nなり、プロデューサーは新曲に子ども達の\r\nコーラスを入れる事を思いつく。", "zh": "真、千鹤、艾莱娜和瑞希将于公演中演唱全新的圣诞歌曲。  \n以4人的圣诞回忆为契机，制作人想到了在新歌中加入孩子们的合唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "eebe485746581362b0f19dee2987e4b131401be63e62c3435599d6387a332928", "ja": "うう～っ、今日も冷えるな～！\n冬本番って感じだね！", "zh": "呜呜～，今天也好冷啊～！\n感觉冬天真的来了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "d74117e78581c3a41cd68c3d1446fc1ffc93e1dde8b49ade0a92ec5040e84444", "ja": "本当ですわね。\n雪が降ってもおかしくないくらいですわ。", "zh": "确实如此。\n冷得都快下雪了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "664d6dde971055b73a342ff505d4bd8e1ecb5759f217528b9045a548345aff63", "ja": "えっ、雪！？\n降ったら、みんなで雪合戦したいヨー！", "zh": "咦，下雪！？\n要是下雪了，我想和大家一起打雪仗哟——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "a668df28be0368ed621fa4aec23c0b47aada2bb69d4439d27185e1df2857b56b", "ja": "雪合戦、できるのではないでしょうか。\n北東エリアなら、もう降っているはずですから。", "zh": "应该可以打雪仗吧。毕竟东北地区的话，现在应该已经下雪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "9fa9aae086dd115651f82a224bd3a92cb0776896804912704fd8555722eeded5", "ja": "あ、そっか！\nじゃあ、ツアー先で雪合戦だネ♪　楽しみだナ～！", "zh": "啊，对哦！\n那就在巡演目的地打雪仗吧♪ 好期待呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1005_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b96dca9ca2e59351d721e4a784ec0d10c6157dfefb1897790d68895e8651b654", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！\nお、全員そろってるみたいだな。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n哦，看来大家都到齐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "9b49c5ea5ffd3b13d05220468880d796e7b07a6be2c4ca5ca58a11920aa2b8c6", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです！\n今日は、次の公演の打ち合わせですよね？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n今天是要商量下场公演的事，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "339d49ecf000d8ab475691bdb7ecbb65bc4c81ed2b75d7d38ba257151834fa8d", "ja": "ああ。みんなにはCLEVER CLOVERとして\n北東エリアをツアーしてもらっているけど……。", "zh": "嗯。虽然大家现在正以CLEVER CLOVER的身份在东北地区巡演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "95d41c0c7970d7900257583babf1fab7550e052d28e61e7b59299132bdb3540a", "ja": "次の公演で披露する新曲を、\nここにいる4人に歌ってもらいたいと思ってる！", "zh": "我想让在场的4人演唱下场公演要披露的新歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "cd3b705f71d1de6ccd80df1d7e98e8116103c6de9cd6689bd90a923ea36fd85d", "ja": "まぁ、わたくしたちに？", "zh": "哎呀，要由我们来唱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "13bc6cc0abcbb431cd654e2982fffc5c605eedfec8fa466670479596e0e516c9", "ja": "ボク、やりたいです！\n{$P$}、どんな曲なんですか？", "zh": "我想做！\n{$P$}，是什么样的歌曲呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "652261407293b7a798b931c5356f94a9c262938e05670e616b5b47604d44a40d", "ja": "それなんだけど。ちょうど12月の公演だから、\nクリスマスソングでいくことにしたよ。", "zh": "就是这件事。正好是12月的公演，所以决定唱圣诞歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "774a3e728456dd8fe806fe68986988d6bcaa820cf0c7df3e1fb14ef3a891c9e5", "ja": "わぁ～、クリスマスソング！？\nいいですね！　今の時期にピッタリで！", "zh": "哇～，圣诞歌吗！？\n太棒了！正适合现在的季节！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "9bfe5db9a415f65d293eec81ac80ef6cbf2dbbd68f069be57b2be8b9582dee5e", "ja": "クリスマスソング……ふふっ。\nまるで、童心に帰ったようで素敵ですわ。", "zh": "圣诞歌……呵呵。\n感觉就像回到了童年一样，真美好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "ca08841f05b768bf7b1311142110ee625c216b9edfe20eaff1df0bbc26c4099c", "ja": "ドウシンに帰る……って、なんだっけ？", "zh": "“回到童心”……是什么意思来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "f1b54755fa2af1c85f182a7f0fba51ac06194a6d81e6b2a43598dc30ff0fe0eb", "ja": "子どもの頃のような気持ちに戻る、\nという意味ですわよ、エレナ。", "zh": "意思是回到像小时候那样的心境，\n艾莲娜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "99cc4e7a9950c4f92c982050f1967d8a9d82bc26c224fe5e925ebf7205944cd8", "ja": "素敵ですね。私は、子どもの頃に戻れるなら、\nサンタさんに会ってみたいです。", "zh": "真不错。要是能回到小时候，我想去见见圣诞老人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "b8017b1d197ebbcd75cfed47e8aeb915142212af16e88d7104d32536a6c5c89f", "ja": "いつも寝てしまって、会えたことがないので。\n……睡魔め。", "zh": "因为我总是睡着，从来没能见到过。\n……可恶的睡魔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "9828720550b6a3437d2fb3f93623c4abcaa1a7c1030f4b4b3a4951be0dd0974f", "ja": "ワタシも戻ってみたいヨー！　ブラジルにいた頃の\nクリスマス、あんまり覚えてないからネ。", "zh": "我也想回去看看呀——！因为不太记得在巴西时的圣诞节了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "4f7d9b65e7d79a497f2c4c0ea88374e1dbe9fa374af15ab101b0d4a23bcfa987", "ja": "家族だけじゃなくて、親戚や友達も集まって、\nみーんなでクリスマスパーティーしてたんだって！", "zh": "不仅是家里人，亲戚和朋友们也都会聚在一起，\n所有人——一起办圣诞派对呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "48f0c219f8d498be4646d0b3dfa3edeb6d70fcb1e8d3a04c732d33682bf9ed13", "ja": "クリスマスパーティーかー。ボクも小さい頃、\nクリスマス会で、みんなと合唱したりしたっけ。", "zh": "圣诞派对啊——我小时候也在圣诞会上和大家一起合唱过来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "561252a9aed9f1b617754fbfb8c1ef9f9a87c2113fe3ab7bffe4845f3b7bb656", "ja": "合唱……懐かしいですわね。わたくしも\n子どもの頃、商店街のイベントで……ゴホン！", "zh": "合唱……真是令人怀念呢。我\n小时候也在商店街的活动上……咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "28f186443eff951c8a5a5dcc3e7c6da6c0abeca38dc175cfee9a4a1fb62990ef", "ja": "し、商店街で、子どもたちの合唱イベントがあると\n聞いたことがありますわ！？", "zh": "听、听说商店街要举办孩子们的合唱活动！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "8a289e4dabfc363d40456bc914065f7e9e46457f5a3def41d585f40e3d4b1120", "ja": "子ども達の合唱か……。\nなるほど、それはいいアイディアかもしれないな。", "zh": "孩子们的合唱啊……。\n原来如此，这说不定是个好主意呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "4b4bc83a8e586556c1df8398c709517110346f84b21b6a8072ce4becec63b76a", "ja": "いいアイディア、ですか？", "zh": "是个好主意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3e1ca484c054751b3d728aa8eebe5ebd8ac76ade1446ca0f2b22a68299108f91", "ja": "うん。どんなクリスマスソングにしようか、\nずっと考えていたんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯。我一直在想，\n要选一首什么样的圣诞歌曲才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "8ce5896337d4f14f8f2c7fa4421cdd89a86879bf8665d16d93d161953f2a6f09", "ja": "子ども達にコーラスとして参加してもらって、\nゴスペル風にするのも良さそうだなって。", "zh": "让孩子们加入合唱，\n做成福音歌曲风格的感觉也很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "f670e1bdc6b1db4914b648aec6d76cacf0cea8ac8293e7c30c093516ef8f335a", "ja": "子どもたちのコーラスで、ゴスペル風……！\nわぁ……すっごくステキですね！", "zh": "孩子们伴唱的福音风格……！\n哇啊……感觉超棒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1029_038chz", "source_sha256": "c12db4ffe5800bd0ac635a56c4af50f3ceb96915ff373f0ffccb49b0022e4fe3", "ja": "ええ。子どもたちと歌うクリスマスソング……\n温かい公演になりそうですわ。", "zh": "是的。和孩子们一起唱圣诞歌……\n这一定会成为一场温暖的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1030_006mak", "source_sha256": "a1f67e45c371d322e7d2db8b7c39c205662d0465a195617f83be954506118a65", "ja": "そうですね。みんなに温かい歌を届けて、ボクたちも\n心が温かくなって……くーっ、楽しみだなぁ♪", "zh": "是啊。把温暖的歌声送给大家，我们的心也会变得温暖……呜——真期待啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "ff12dfe3086553ab8cc132424653c67b4d22044a490fc78300aaf2f0733ecaad", "ja": "（みんな乗り気になってくれてよかった。\nそれじゃ、コーラスの子ども達を探すとするか！）", "zh": "（大家都愿意参加，真是太好了。那就去找合唱的孩子们吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
